#
# direnv entry point for this SDK. `direnv allow` in this directory, then the
# shell below is entered by `devenv shell`. The development shell is the
# canonical way to work on this package; `nix develop` is not required and no
# parity claim is made for it.
#
# Nothing here names a host path, a user name or a store path.
use devenv